{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_6E19BAB5","title":"Rigs","entry":"Dlg_6E19BAB5::entry","exit":"Dlg_6E19BAB5::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_B02465AB","articyId":"72057778721526859","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"So, you're back. And you got something on your mind. More fun to be had? Got a fire you need lit? Maybe under someone's ass?","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So, you're back. And you got something on your mind. More fun to be had? Got a fire you need lit? Maybe under someone's ass?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-200.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36740","byteOffset":28242280,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_EE255FA7","articyId":"72057778721526886","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Just as well. Oil burns and we got a slick-sea's worth right now. So if no fires, then whatchya doing out here?","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Just as well. Oil burns and we got a slick-sea's worth right now. So if no fires, then whatchya doing out here?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":400.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40003","byteOffset":29463688,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_C30F784F","articyId":"72057778721526894","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Not gonna say yes and not gonna say no.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Not gonna say yes and not gonna say no.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":400.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23273","byteOffset":16686088,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_7601C1C1","articyId":"72057778721526908","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Cause and effect. Action and reaction. Just waiting for you to spark the convo, Cosmo.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Cause and effect. Action and reaction. Just waiting for you to spark the convo, Cosmo.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1000.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41821","byteOffset":30148808,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_0E35FF63","articyId":"72057778721526922","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Damn, you found one of the good ones. Where you get it? You kill a synth and pull it off their chest? Nah, that's not your style. Stole it, didn't ya?","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Damn, you found one of the good ones. Where you get it? You kill a synth and pull it off their chest? Nah, that's not your style. Stole it, didn't ya?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1600.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43818","byteOffset":30908480,"byteLength":544}},{"id":"DFr_AE5D933E","articyId":"72057778721526951","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Sure. So... What did happen?","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure. So... What did happen?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2200.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33884","byteOffset":20701752,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_9B932C2A","articyId":"72057778721526960","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Sure. You keep telling yourself that and I'll say Finlay didn't use the water cooler to store gasoline.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure. You keep telling yourself that and I'll say Finlay didn't use the water cooler to store gasoline.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2200.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19938","byteOffset":15426920,"byteLength":448}},{"id":"DFr_6579672E","articyId":"72057778721526981","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"What's to say? Whatever synth lost this was either running or was already caught. My bet's on the latter.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What's to say? Whatever synth lost this was either running or was already caught. My bet's on the latter.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2775.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18903","byteOffset":15038648,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_BBC67C7D","articyId":"72057778721526996","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Yeah. Synths are just anatomically correct computers with a bit of adaptive AI and cosmetic surgery thrown in.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yeah. Synths are just anatomically correct computers with a bit of adaptive AI and cosmetic surgery thrown in.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3975.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25159","byteOffset":17399920,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_95BD2BB2","articyId":"72057778721527017","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Uh huh. You heard them say, \"no good deed goes unpunished?\" You wanna return that pin you gotta figure out where the next A.A.A. meeting is.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Uh huh. You heard them say, \"no good deed goes unpunished?\" You wanna return that pin you gotta figure out where the next A.A.A. meeting is.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4575.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26002","byteOffset":17718632,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_2873A22A","articyId":"72057778721527032","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"You don't. Unless you got an AI interface grafted into your skull, and I ain't talkin' bout your little Automata there either.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You don't. Unless you got an AI interface grafted into your skull, and I ain't talkin' bout your little Automata there either.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5175.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48441","byteOffset":32661224,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_829DAC8B","articyId":"72057778721527053","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Like that's my aim in life, Cosmo.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Like that's my aim in life, Cosmo.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":5775.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47464","byteOffset":32292328,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_F82B1878","articyId":"72057778721527060","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Why you asking me, Cosmo?","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Why you asking me, Cosmo?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":5775.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33363","byteOffset":20506216,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_8620A2CF","articyId":"72057611218144209","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Thank me with deeds, not with words.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thank me with deeds, not with words.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7275.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17451","byteOffset":14489736,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_8220093D","articyId":"72057821671306629","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Reached the end of his shelf life, you know? No more firmware for the fun loving captain.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Reached the end of his shelf life, you know? No more firmware for the fun loving captain.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3375.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39609","byteOffset":29313720,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_12AC35D1","articyId":"72057821671306643","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"They aren't exactly alive, though \"dead\" is too strong a word.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"They aren't exactly alive, though \"dead\" is too strong a word.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3375.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48367","byteOffset":32634048,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_082EC3E3","articyId":"72057821671306672","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"You need to talk to their employer - find out what caused them to reach the useful life limit on their contract.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You need to talk to their employer - find out what caused them to reach the useful life limit on their contract.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":6675.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32471","byteOffset":20166728,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_B7A1C3F9","articyId":"72057821671306686","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"You wanna help your friend or whoever this synth is to you?","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You wanna help your friend or whoever this synth is to you?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":6075.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39581","byteOffset":29303624,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_F77E8B99","articyId":"72057821671306698","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"It's getting only harder from here if you really want to do this.","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's getting only harder from here if you really want to do this.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7275.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47566","byteOffset":32332672,"byteLength":376}},{"id":"DFr_B8AF90E0","articyId":"72057821671306720","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Delbert Cherry","text":"Looking for work?","speakerId":"Ntt_C2EFECA2","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Looking for work?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":-200.0,"y":650.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25870","byteOffset":17669584,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_97DE4DC1","articyId":"72057821671306727","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"No, just information.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No, just information.","TextSheVersion":"No, just information.","TextTheyVersion":"No, just information."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":100.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49727","byteOffset":33154536,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_D2D4BF63","articyId":"72057778721526864","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No fires.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No fires.","TextSheVersion":"No fires.","TextTheyVersion":"No fires."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":100.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33525","byteOffset":20565944,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_717765A3","articyId":"72057778721526